WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.948 line:82%
Chapter 21. MI WAY Remote: run your class from your own phone.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:15.249 line:82%
MI WAY Remote is a small Android app for your own phone. You walk around the class, and the laptop and the projector follow your phone.

00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:18.849 line:82%
On the live screen, press "Phone remote".

00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:27.609 line:82%
Scan this QR code with your phone, and tap "Download the app". It comes from your laptop: no Play Store, and no internet.

00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:36.609 line:82%
Open the app, and type the PIN from the laptop. You do it only once: next time, the app finds your laptop by itself.

00:00:37.075 --> 00:00:41.189 line:82%
The Quiz tab runs the test. Start the first question.

00:00:41.643 --> 00:00:47.289 line:82%
You see who has not answered yet, and the right answer. Only you see it, on your phone.

00:00:47.744 --> 00:00:54.590 line:82%
"Reveal answer", "Leaderboard", "Next question", and "Talk and answer again" are on the phone too.

00:00:55.046 --> 00:01:03.270 line:82%
The Attendance tab: tap present, absent or late for each student. Then "Everyone else is present" marks the others.

00:01:03.727 --> 00:01:09.470 line:82%
The Points tab: tap a student, then a reason, to give a thumbs up or a thumbs down.

00:01:09.938 --> 00:01:17.111 line:82%
The Pick tab picks a student at random. The name shows on the projector too. A good answer? Give a point.

00:01:17.572 --> 00:01:23.471 line:82%
iPhone? Open the remote in Safari, with the same QR code and PIN.
